== Icelandic ==
{{Is-Numeral(þrír)|þrjátíu og }}
===Etymology===
From ''[[þrjátíu]]'' meaning "[[thirty]]" + ''[[og]]'' "[[and]]" + ''[[þrír]]'' "[[three]]". Meaning '''thirty and three'''.
